  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『デジモンアドベンチャー』より、オメガモンがFigure-rise Standard Amplifiedで登場！",
      "en": "From \"Digimon Adventure\", Omegamon appears in Figure-rise Standard Amplified!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 原作リスペクトの元、キャラクターの魅力を“増幅”させたAMPLIFIEDシリーズ第1弾！",
      "en": "• The first installment of the AMPLIFIED series, which respects the original work and amplifies the charm of the characters!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 各パーツの配色を成形色で再現。白いパーツにはグロスインジェクションを採用。",
      "en": "• The color scheme of each part is reproduced with molded colors. Gloss injection is used for white parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• オメガモンの魅力を更に際立たせるために、各パーツをシャープ化。",
      "en": "• In order to further highlight Omegamon's charm, each part has been sharpened."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腰部の拡張用３mm穴がプラモデルとしての可能性をさらに増幅(AMPLIFIED)。",
      "en": "• The 3mm expansion hole in the waist area further amplifies its potential as a plastic model (AMPLIFIED)."
    }
  ],
